# What never enters the API image or its build context: secrets, local state, tenant data, keys, documentation,
# tests and tooling. The Dockerfile copies runtime directories explicitly; this list also keeps the context small
# for `wrangler deploy`, which builds the image from the repository root (wrangler.jsonc: image_build_context).
.env
.env.*
state/
tenants/
vault/
maildrop/
docs/
tests/
.git/
.github/
node_modules/
.venv*/
.neon
.wrangler/
*.key
*.key.dev
samples/
BL.md
README.md
edge/
scripts/
.claude/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
docker/
wrangler.jsonc
neon.ts
package.json
package-lock.json
skills-lock.json
